<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17141" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτολμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>daring nothing, cowardly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				11.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.39
			</span></i>(
				Comp.
			), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῆμα . . οὐκ ἄ. ἀλλ᾽ ἕτοιμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					458
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. καὶ μαλακός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					8.68
				</span></i>
			, etc.; of women, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. αἰχμά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					630
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἐπινόημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.75d
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. εἰμι . .
				δῆσαι</span> I have <i>not the heart</i> to bind, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.103.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.47c
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερον</span>”
				<i>less boldly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.37
				</span></i>
			.</div>
